  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這些孩子們是\n垃圾袋寶可夢破破袋。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E9B5B695B505011662F000A5783573E888B5BF653EF592278347834888B3002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠們好像是喜歡上了\n我們咖啡館的廚餘，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n變得會聚集在店面這裡……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72605011597D50CF662F559C6B614E0A4E86000A6211501154965561992876845EDA9918FF0C00100001BE00000A8B8A5F976703805A96C657285E979762901988E120262026001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破噠～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78345660FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我很高興咖啡館的食物\n能讓破破袋們也喜歡，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但有些人會怕破破袋的氣味，\n所以客人變少了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662115F889AD88208549655619928768498DF7269000A80FD8B9378347834888B50114E5F559C6B61FF0C00100001BE01000A4F4667094E9B4EBA6703601578347834888B76846C235473FF0C000A62404EE55BA24EBA8B8A5C114E863002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然破破袋們是為了我們的廚餘而來，\n那就好好利用這件事吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E2713678347834888B5011662F70BA4E866211501176845EDA9918800C4F86FF0C000A90A35C31597D597D5229752890194EF64E8B5427FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可以用我們的廚餘……美味垃圾，\n把破破袋們帶到垃圾場去嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4EE575286211501176845EDA9918202620267F8E54735783573EFF0C000A628A78347834888B50115E3652305783573E583453BB55CEFF1F001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好，就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597DFF0C5C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B356C9FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這裡今天是對戰特區呢……\n那就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳明天再來帶破破袋囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901988E14ECA5929662F5C0D623072795340546220262026000A90A35C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3660E5929518D4F865E3678347834888B56C9FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳把破破袋\n帶到垃圾場去。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F38ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3628A78347834888B000A5E3652305783573E583453BB300200100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D4E8655CEFF1F001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒問題！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92554F984CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "稍等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A0D7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是我現在\n暫時沒辦法抽身呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F621173FE5728000A66AB66426C928FA66CD562BD8EAB54623002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n真是好幫手！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A771F662F597D5E6B624BFF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶著這個，破破袋\n應該就會跟著<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳到垃圾場了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898100100003110000FF01014F6059B35E3684579019500BFF0C78347834888B000A61C98A725C3167038DDF845700100003110000FF01014F6059B352305783573E58344E863002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "記得要慢慢走，\n這樣破破袋才不會跟丟了喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A185F978981616261628D70FF0C000A90196A2378347834888B624D4E0D67038DDF4E1F4E865594FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沿著這條路直走到底，\n就會到垃圾場了！拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CBF84579019689D8DEF76F48D7052305E95FF0C000A5C31670352305783573E58344E86FF0162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B356C9FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳沿著這條路直走，\n然後把美味垃圾放在路底處。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B36CBF84579019689D8DEF76F48D70FF0C000A71365F8C628A7F8E54735783573E653E57288DEF5E9586553002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沿著路直走，\n把破破袋帶到路底處吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CBF84578DEF76F48D70FF0C000A628A78347834888B5E3652308DEF5E9586555427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要把美味垃圾\n放在垃圾場嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981628A7F8E54735783573E000A653E57285783573E583455CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "放下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "653E4E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不放",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D653E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噗破噠～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "565778345660FF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破破袋們忘我地吃著\n美味垃圾……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78347834888B50115FD86211573054038457000A7F8E54735783573E202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我把垃圾拿過來！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B6211628A5783573E62FF904E4F86FF01001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這裡的話，破破袋們的氣味\n就不會飄到咖啡館去了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901988E176848A71FF0C78347834888B501176846C235473000A5C314E0D670398C4523054965561992853BB4E863002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破破袋們吃得好豪邁呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78347834888B501154035F97597D8C6A908154403002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我忍不住想了一下……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n和寶可夢一起生活，\n並不只是和寶可夢常相左右呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115FCD4E0D4F4F60F34E864E004E0B2026202600100001BE01000A548C5BF653EF59224E008D77751F6D3BFF0C000A4E264E0D53EA662F548C5BF653EF59225E3876F85DE653F354623002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破破袋喜歡吃咖啡館的飯！\n但我又不能讓牠們在店那邊吃飯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78347834888B559C6B615403549655619928768498EFFF01000A4F46621153C84E0D80FD8B937260501157285E9790A3908A540398EF3002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像這樣找出恰到好處的距離，\n說不定也是一種和寶可夢共生的方式。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕľ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF90196A23627E51FA60705230597D865576848DDD96E2FF0C000A8AAA4E0D5B9A4E5F662F4E007A2E548C5BF653EF59225171751F768465B95F0F3002001000020114013E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢跟在後面走……\n光是這樣就好可愛啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF59228DDF57285F8C97628D7020262026000A5149662F90196A235C31597D53EF611B554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉呀？這香氣，\n似乎有點濃烈呢……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55095440FF1F901999996C23FF0C000A4F3C4E4E67099EDE6FC370C85462202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總覺得和列陣兵好像喔。\n看起來真不簡單，要加油啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E3D89BA5F97548C521796635175597D50CF55943002000A770B8D774F86771F4E0D7C2155AEFF0C898152A06CB9554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "破破袋牠們是會\n幫忙吃垃圾的對吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78347834888B72605011662F6703000A5E6B5FD954035783573E76845C0D542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳平安完成\n與破破袋們的小旅行了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B35E735B895B8C6210000A820778347834888B501176845C0F65C5884C4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    }
